      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name} Discord lets you disable ALL animations in the Discord client. It's all or nothing. And that sucks. I got an icon frame and nameplate with the orbs they give you and for months, did not know they were animated.\n\nIt'd be nice if I could just disable the animations on a field I read a lot of text from... like a profile.",
